# Objective :
Display successful RDP logons using service accounts , why ?
If this happens, it may indicate credential abuse or lateral movement.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1-) Event ID Used : 4624 # Successful Logon #
2-) Logon Type : Successful Logon # RDP Logon #
3-) KQL Filter : event.code:4624 AND winlog.logon.type:RemoteInteractive AND user.name: svc-*
4-) Fields Used in the Table :
user.name.keyword => Username
host.hostname.keyword => The machine where the logon attempt occurred
related.ip.keyword => The IP address of the machine that initiated the RDP connection
Count of records => Number of times the event occurred
